cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use UzBLiMP, please cite it as below."
title: "UzBLiMP: A Benchmark of Linguistic Minimal Pairs for Uzbek in Three Alphabets"
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Norbaev
    given-names: Kattabek
  - family-names: Matniyozov
    given-names: Javohir
version: "1.2"
date-released: "2026-11-21"
repository-code: "https://github.com/kattabeknorbaev/uzblimp"
license: CC-BY-SA-4.0
abstract: >-
  2,400 Uzbek minimal pairs for 16 grammatical phenomena (150 each), built from attested corpus
  sentences by one controlled edit, in current Latin, Cyrillic and the reformed 2026 Latin alphabet,
  with an evaluation of 17 language models and a forced-choice human validation.
keywords:
  - Uzbek
  - minimal pairs
  - benchmark
  - language models
  - BLiMP
